        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/9436d4a38712f11ffe8bbc68f379e159.poster.avif?t=1752393047\" width=706 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/9436d4a38712f11ffe8bbc68f379e159.webm?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/9436d4a38712f11ffe8bbc68f379e159.mp4?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the mysterious house of a witch in this short adventure game to find the answers behind a hunter's quest. A strange presence looms over you, you cannot turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique hand-drawn artstyle inspired by <i>Angel's Egg </i>and old fairytales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles and easy gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house, read documents and speak to the witch to resolve the dangers inside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and eerie experience to be finished in one sitting (under an hour)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/75cdc3b5d57cfeb22546f7d6499ab6b6.poster.avif?t=1752393047\" width=706 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/75cdc3b5d57cfeb22546f7d6499ab6b6.webm?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/75cdc3b5d57cfeb22546f7d6499ab6b6.mp4?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up useful objects in your inventory, use them alone or combined to get through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/b3d7e99a73d5677be4f9e2a49093f227.poster.avif?t=1752393047\" width=706 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/b3d7e99a73d5677be4f9e2a49093f227.webm?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/b3d7e99a73d5677be4f9e2a49093f227.mp4?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search around the house to find the writings of its occupants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>God in a Closet is an indie project made by a solo developer/artist.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/9436d4a38712f11ffe8bbc68f379e159.poster.avif?t=1752393047\" width=706 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/9436d4a38712f11ffe8bbc68f379e159.webm?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/9436d4a38712f11ffe8bbc68f379e159.mp4?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the mysterious house of a witch in this short adventure game to find the answers behind a hunter's quest. A strange presence looms over you, you cannot turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique hand-drawn artstyle inspired by <i>Angel's Egg </i>and old fairytales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles and easy gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house, read documents and speak to the witch to resolve the dangers inside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and eerie experience to be finished in one sitting (under an hour)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/75cdc3b5d57cfeb22546f7d6499ab6b6.poster.avif?t=1752393047\" width=706 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/75cdc3b5d57cfeb22546f7d6499ab6b6.webm?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/75cdc3b5d57cfeb22546f7d6499ab6b6.mp4?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up useful objects in your inventory, use them alone or combined to get through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/b3d7e99a73d5677be4f9e2a49093f227.poster.avif?t=1752393047\" width=706 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/b3d7e99a73d5677be4f9e2a49093f227.webm?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549350/extras/b3d7e99a73d5677be4f9e2a49093f227.mp4?t=1752393047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search around the house to find the writings of its occupants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>God in a Closet is an indie project made by a solo developer/artist.</i></p>",
